en:
@unlockby:6807@
An attack that deals $s1% weapon damage, applying |cFFFFFFFFInfected Blood|r to your target, dealing $81400o1 damage over $81400d.

|cFFFFFFFFMaul|r spreads |cFFFFFFFFInfected Blood|r and |cFFFFFFFFRabies|r to all nearby enemies. Dealing damage with |cFFFFFFFFInfected Blood|r grants a stack of |cFFFFFFFFBlightheart|r.

@ext:Scales with Maul modifiers. Effects which increase Bleed damage also increase the weapon damage.:ext@

