en:
Your damaging abilities have a $h% chance to exorcise your target, leaving an area of light causing Holy damage at the target's location. 

Struck targets take $984961s1% increased Holy damage from the caster for $984961d.

@ext:These effects scale with your Exorcism and Consecration abilities.:ext@

