Your Hand of Freedom spell has a $s3% chance to remove all stun effects on the target. 

@ext:If a stun effect is removed, the normal effect of Hand of Freedom will not be applied.:ext@
@ext::ext@
Capstone Bonus: Your Hand of Freedom now also increases the movement speed of the target by 30%.

