Teaches you |cFFFFFFFFTitanic Mutilate|r.

|cFFFFFFFFBloodthirst|r deals 12% more damage per active combo point.

|cFFFFFFFFWhirlwind|r deals $s3% more damage vs monsters. Dealing damage with Whirlwind triggers |cFFFFFFFFBloodrage|r (if known). 

@ext:This Enrage effect will not grant a Raging Blow charge.:ext@

