en:
@req:44549@
@req:44545@
When you damage enemies with |cFFFFFFFFFrostbolt|r  gain an |cFFFFFFFFIcicle|r for 20 sec (up to 5 stacks).

Dealing damage with |cFFFFFFFFIce Lance|r launches all stored Icicles at the target, dealing Frost damage. You can't gain new Icicles while they are launching.

The fifth Icicle triggers |cFFFFFFFFBrainfreeze|r.

|cFFFFFFFFBrain freeze|r now also grants |cFFFFFFFFFrostflame Shock!|r.
